! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

!

'initial condition - variably saturated flow'

1                             ;number of zones



! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

'number and name of zone'

1

'zone 1'



'initial condition'

0.0



'extent of zone'

0.0 10.0  0.0 10.0  0.0 1.0



'end of zone'



'done'



